{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 6.199999809265137, "text": "This piece right here is approximately 50,036.27 pounds of mass.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 6.199999809265137, "end_seconds": 7.0, "text": "Approximately.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 7.0, "end_seconds": 8.399999618530273, "text": "Approximately, yeah.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 8.399999618530273, "end_seconds": 11.600000381469727, "text": "There are 20 50,000 pound increments in this machine.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 11.600000381469727, "end_seconds": 13.399999618530273, "text": "20 times 50 equals 1 million pounds.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 13.399999618530273, "end_seconds": 16.600000381469727, "text": "Cumulatively, that's 4.45 meganewton.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 16.600000381469727, "end_seconds": 19.5, "text": "These are the largest mass objects ever calibrated.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 19.5, "end_seconds": 21.200000762939453, "text": "The machine works like this.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 21.200000762939453, "end_seconds": 24.5, "text": "Below ground are the 20 carefully calibrated masses.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 24.5, "end_seconds": 27.100000381469727, "text": "Their weight is used to calibrate force sensors,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 27.100000381469727, "end_seconds": 31.200000762939453, "text": "also called force transducers, in the lab upstairs.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 31.200000762939453, "end_seconds": 34.79999923706055, "text": "One of these will be placed on the compression head right here.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 34.79999923706055, "end_seconds": 39.20000076293945, "text": "Then a hydraulic ram in the attic starts to raise the green lifting frame.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 39.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 42.599998474121094, "text": "And once the force transducer contacts the red loading frame,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 42.599998474121094, "end_seconds": 46.0, "text": "well then it starts lifting the weights downstairs.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 46.0, "end_seconds": 48.099998474121094, "text": "And as the lifting frame continues to rise,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 48.099998474121094, "end_seconds": 53.20000076293945, "text": "more and more of the 50,000 pound weights become suspended by the force sensor.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 53.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 56.0, "text": "And since the weights create an accurately known force,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "3HQkVfZ4DNY", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 56.0, "end_seconds": 59.5, "text": "the readouts from the force transducer can be precisely calibrated.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
